{"id": "1539747603732766751", "channel_id": "1539681545445707927", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Hello there and welcome aboard : )\n\nFirst off, did you find Cheri's handbook ? ( just type /new if you didn't ).\n\nYou can also try /char and select your favorite awakeners for gameplay tips.", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T21:27:15.857000+00:00", "thread_id": "1539681545445707927", "thread_title": "What teams to build?", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1539747905794089062", "channel_id": "1539681545445707927", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "That being said, I feel the more efficient way to select your teams if just to play the game :\n\n- Pick 1 awakener you like\n- If you think another might work well with, add them\n- Fill the blanks randomly\n\nAfter a while, you should be able to find out what suits you or not u.u", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T21:28:27.874000+00:00", "thread_id": "1539681545445707927", "thread_title": "What teams to build?", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1539747052127264829", "channel_id": "1539604514368127077", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Hello there : )\n\nI get how you feel but there's no really effective shortcut as far as I know.\n\nIf you don't care about the high score rewards, there's always the option to go for a low-cost team and play your cards as fast as you can u.u\n\nI honestly don't think it's worth the hassle if you don't enjoy this part of the game.", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T21:25:04.344000+00:00", "thread_id": "1539604514368127077", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-20T21:38:55.338000+00:00", "thread_title": "Can someone teach me Traphase skip tecnique?", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747463379390545"]}
